      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_8",
      "quote": "We used the following score ranges to rate the potential risk of bias of individual studies: low risk of bias for studies achieving 70% or more 'yes' scores; moderate risk of bias for studies obtaining between 50 and 69% 'yes' scores (noting studies below 60% were excluded); and high risk of bias if the number of 'yes' scores was below 50%",
      "reason": "An overall risk-of-bias judgement was made and the explicit scoring rules to derive it are reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
